    "detailed_description": "<strong>Milksoup</strong> is an FPS tower defense about an army of little red dumplings trying to steal your cereal.<br>Movement will be your key to survival as you strafe and b-hop throughout the surreal environments; The longer you last, the more scrap you earn to build towers that help you defend against the ever-increasing hoard. With a variety of goons emerging from the roster, you'll have to strategize your playstyle for each wave you find yourself in.<br>Ever need a break? Go into a Sandbox map and explore the nooks and crannies of the world you inhabit.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MOVE</h2></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627270/extras/c5552942c4ee9e49cb6c7e7c8343f72d.poster.avif?t=1722142976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627270/extras/c5552942c4ee9e49cb6c7e7c8343f72d.webm?t=1722142976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627270/extras/c5552942c4ee9e49cb6c7e7c8343f72d.mp4?t=1722142976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>-<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Utilize the various techniques in your moveset including strafe-jumping, sliding, and b-hopping.<br></li><li> With physics-based movement, you can stay on a roll with persistent momentum while moving across maps.<br></li><li> Equip various weapons that can be abused to bring you to greater heights, like a gun's intense aerial knockback.</li></ul><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ATTACK</h2></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627270/extras/830cf407a00f2c0decc08e0419e0ff82.poster.avif?t=1722142976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627270/extras/830cf407a00f2c0decc08e0419e0ff82.webm?t=1722142976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627270/extras/830cf407a00f2c0decc08e0419e0ff82.mp4?t=1722142976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>-<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Take advantage of your arsenal, equipping melee and ranged weapons to swap between quickly.<br></li><li> Overwhelm enemies with unique combos that take them down quickly.<br></li><li> Experiment and find what weapons work best against the various dumplings in the hoard.</li></ul><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEFEND</h2></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627270/extras/15f575c57304a38548c760aff8370d04.poster.avif?t=1722142976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627270/extras/15f575c57304a38548c760aff8370d04.webm?t=1722142976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627270/extras/15f575c57304a38548c760aff8370d04.mp4?t=1722142976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>-<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Craft various towers that stave off the hoard.<br></li><li> Upgrade your towers to fill different niches, like burning through gangs of smaller enemies or chipping away at heftier dumplings.<br></li><li> Reap the rewards and feed them back into your defense system.</li></ul><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPERIMENT</h2></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627270/extras/1c6787277e3397ec1bc3cc7dc30d4a0c.poster.avif?t=1722142976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627270/extras/1c6787277e3397ec1bc3cc7dc30d4a0c.webm?t=1722142976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627270/extras/1c6787277e3397ec1bc3cc7dc30d4a0c.mp4?t=1722142976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>-<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Find hidden easter eggs in the sandbox maps.<br></li><li> Use the Spawn Gun to spawn enemies and test their strengths and weaknesses.<br></li><li> Gain unlimited access to all Towers and their upgrades while in sandbox maps.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Milksoup</strong> is an FPS tower defense about an army of little red dumplings trying to steal your cereal.<br>Movement will be your key to survival as you strafe and b-hop throughout the surreal environments; The longer you last, the more scrap you earn to build towers that help you defend against the ever-increasing hoard. With a variety of goons emerging from the roster, you'll have to strategize your playstyle for each wave you find yourself in.<br>Ever need a break? Go into a Sandbox map and explore the nooks and crannies of the world you inhabit.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MOVE</h2></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627270/extras/c5552942c4ee9e49cb6c7e7c8343f72d.poster.avif?t=1722142976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627270/extras/c5552942c4ee9e49cb6c7e7c8343f72d.webm?t=1722142976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627270/extras/c5552942c4ee9e49cb6c7e7c8343f72d.mp4?t=1722142976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>-<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Utilize the various techniques in your moveset including strafe-jumping, sliding, and b-hopping.<br></li><li> With physics-based movement, you can stay on a roll with persistent momentum while moving across maps.<br></li><li> Equip various weapons that can be abused to bring you to greater heights, like a gun's intense aerial knockback.</li></ul><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ATTACK</h2></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627270/extras/830cf407a00f2c0decc08e0419e0ff82.poster.avif?t=1722142976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1