type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627270/extras/1c6787277e3397ec1bc3cc7dc30d4a0c.mp4?t=1722142976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>-<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Find hidden easter eggs in the sandbox maps.<br></li><li> Use the Spawn Gun to spawn enemies and test their strengths and weaknesses.<br></li><li> Gain unlimited access to all Towers and their upgrades while in sandbox maps.</li></ul>",
